If you start at the vertical TWO and move it once to the right and then over diagonally to the left until it is right over the S. THIS is the S hole. Keep the H there and you will see U L B S. Move the two SSs below that up to the line above and you will have a triple S. Then take TWO and place it on the triple S, which will make a triple S Hole. 
Then, widening the hole, means widening the S hole.  And don’t forget B-there. Make sure to farm the S hole and widen it of B-there.

